==Enemy==
While his speed may look indimidating, his range is incredibly low, and his DPS isn't all too high. However multiple Hyper Messrs will spawn during battle. Using 3-4 meatshields should be enough to hold him off along with supporting attacks like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]]. Strong cats like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] or [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] will also be able to take him out.

